{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "Full Lifecycle: Note Submission, Groups, Streaks & Confetti / ノート投稿からカレンダー反映までの全ライフサイクル",
  "tags": [
    "Full Lifecycle",
    "Note Submission",
    "Streak Engine",
    "Firestore Transaction",
    "Group Chat Sync"
